WEBVTT

NOTE
'Waltz for the Moon' — Squall and Rinoa's full dance at the SeeD ball.
Duration: approximately 1 minute 33 seconds.

00:00.000 --> 00:05.200
Rinoa leads the stiff, reluctant Squall into a waltz across the ballroom.

00:15.130 --> 00:19.910
The two clasp hands and turn together among the other dancers.

00:23.870 --> 00:28.220
They spin across the floor in time with the music.

00:31.870 --> 00:36.220
Fireworks burst in the night sky beyond the tall windows.

00:45.870 --> 00:50.220
Squall and Rinoa continue the waltz, moving more in step.

01:07.730 --> 01:12.930
The dance ends; Rinoa breaks away and slips into the crowd.

01:24.930 --> 01:27.530
Squall stands alone, gazing after her.
